Antisèches | HackTricks | https://book.hacktricks.xyz/
Antisèches | Reverse Shell Generator (revshells) | https://www.revshells.com/
Antisèches | PEASS-ng (linpeas / winpeas) | https://github.com/carlospolop/PEASS-ng

